  "description": "Graduate the Academy by Luck is a trash VR game loved by no one—except for him. But that doesn’t mean he wanted to end up inside of it! After transmigrating into the body of a young female character named Oknodie, this protagonist will have to start from the bottom of a hierarchy based on luck. With only his wits and the help of a few new friends, will he be able to raise Oknodie up and win the game, or will he be trapped inside the body of a weakling character forever?! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
